    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110031\">@Patrick Massot</span> Thank you very much for your feedback  it is truly very insightful.</p>\n<p>My main goal is pedagogical: I am trying to bridge the gap between informal mathematical reasoning (at the level of high school / early undergraduate students) and formal proofs in Lean.So, I aim to guide students through a structured reasoning process that reflects how they would solve problems on paper, and then progressively translate that into Lean.Your remark about the injectivity of the conjugation is particularly interesting.I also find your version very interesting, as it is much more compact and closer to the mathlib style. Thanks again for sharing your proof.</p>",
        "id": 584429810,
        "sender_full_name": "Soltani Mehrez",
        "timestamp": 1775735119
    },
